      "uid": "zhcn:748d09648773e45244b6b760",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈！真不愧是“皇帝”大人，\n无论何时何地都会提到“她们”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bc30dca31eb1acf2eec410060552e567904278789557c54a6568ac3a09ef2fc",
