    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:642e53b63597879c99033e97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会不会是忌妒她的实力呢？\n听说她在学园里可是率领着不良学生……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea2042acdcca47573a22234f82aa17ceb30ee96a352e3241448fc7892b7627a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070fd423ddf0830ac1ad16d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这些话我可不能当作没听见，\n于是我转身走向传出声音的茶水间。\n不过──",
